+
+/* [generic nl80211 port] Apply the regulatory domain.
+ *
+ * The kernel can only apply a country when the regulatory database
+ * (/lib/firmware/regulatory.db, i.e. /system/lib/firmware on this product) is
+ * loaded.  The automatic load of the kernel happens before /system is
+ * mounted, so it usually fails; the database therefore has to be reloaded
+ * explicitly from user space (NL80211_CMD_RELOAD_REGDB) and only then the
+ * country can be set (NL80211_CMD_REQ_SET_REG).
